OpenMP parallel differentiation support for ADOL-C

Provides thread-safe automatic differentiation using OpenMP directives.
ADOLC_OpenMP and ADOLC_OpenMP_NC handler classes manage tape state
across parallel regions.

**Usage:**
```cpp
#pragma omp parallel ADOLC_OPENMP
{
    // Each thread gets independent tape state
    trace_on(tag);
    // ... AD computations ...
    trace_off();
}
```

@note Requires compilation with -fopenmp or equivalent
